     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thanks for this answer. I&#39;ve had this server for some time and have made different software installs (typically Postgres / GIS related).<br><br>Is there a way I can test if GCC / scl / devtoolset is installed properly, or - at least identify what I need to do to identify the source of the problem?<br><br>Thanks again!</div>"
